        <mxCell id="dns" value="&lt;b&gt;DNSTap-WS2025&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Windows Server 2025 Core&lt;br&gt;DNS Server role • 172.27.215.163/20&lt;br&gt;Zone: example.test" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#eaf3fb;strokeColor=#4b84b5;fontColor=#17324d;fontSize=13;spacing=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;" vertex="1" parent="1">
